====Equipment====
*Equipment with high strength bonus for Melee, and magic damage for Mage
*Melee and mage weapons, such as [[Emberlight]] and [[Purging staff]]
*Punish weapons, such as [[Dharok's greataxe]] and/or [[Heavy ballista]] (with [[dragon javelin]]s)
====Inventory====
*1-2 [[Divine super combat potion]]s
*6-8 [[Super restore]]s
